01:01:41.980 --> 01:01:53.470
<v Ira Glass>Special thanks today to Rebecca Huntley, who you heard in the opening of our program. One of the things that she did after her wake-up moment is write a book. It's called How to Talk About Climate in a Way That Makes a Difference, which is where we first heard of her.
<v Ira Glass>特别感谢今天节目开头提到的丽贝卡·亨特利。她在觉醒时刻后做的事情之一就是写了一本书。书名是《如何以有意义的方式谈论气候》，我们就是在那儿第一次了解到她的。

01:01:53.470 --> 01:02:12.270
