<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He was making fun of me this week because he found out that I am really into skateboards. Though, I have to say, not the entire skateboard, OK? I don't care about the deck or the wheels.
<v Ira Glass>照例，感谢我们节目的联合创始人托雷·马拉蒂亚先生。他这周取笑我，因为他发现我真的很迷滑板。不过，我得说，不是整个滑板，好吗？我不关心滑板面或轮子。

01:02:24.370 --> 01:02:31.330
<v Michael Foster>Wow, you're super passionate about trucks. I just didn't know you're so into trucks. Was this always a thing? I think it's really great.
<v Michael Foster>哇，你对滑板支架真是超级热衷啊。我只是不知道你这么迷恋支架。这一直是你的一项爱好吗？我觉得真的很棒。

01:02:31.330 --> 01:02:36.330
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
